  "title": "CMake: Fix static linking against GLib2",
  "description": "GLib2 >= 2.73.2 links against PCRE2, not the older PCRE.\nIf we found GLib2 with pkg-config, trust what pkg-config gave us.\nOtherwise, use the version to determine which PCRE to use.\n\nFix #20344 (although there's lots of other static linking issues.)",
