      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 2343263599,
          "type": null,
          "body": "But, working around that with more ugliness, I now see:\n\n```\nroot@43e8ceacdafb:/work/build/run# ls -ltr\ntotal 2950104\n-rwxr-xr-x. 1 1000 1000   9164440 Feb 12 01:57 lemon\n-rw-r--r--. 1 1000 1000   1426370 Feb 12 01:57 libwsutil.a\n-rw-r--r--. 1 1000 1000   4108778 Feb 12 01:57 libui.a\n-rw-r--r--. 1 1000 1000   8827604 Feb 12 01:57 libwiretap.a\n-rw-r--r--. 1 1000 1000 797493746 Feb 12 01:58 libwireshark.a\n-rwxr-xr-x. 1 1000 1000 366641704 Feb 12 02:44 fuzzshark_udp_port-dhcp\n-rwxr-xr-x. 1 1000 1000 366641304 Feb 12 02:44 fuzzshark\n-rwxr-xr-x. 1 1000 1000 366641824 Feb 12 02:44 fuzzshark_udp_port-dns\n-rwxr-xr-x. 1 1000 1000 366641704 Feb 12 02:44 fuzzshark_media_type-json\n-rwxr-xr-x. 1 1000 1000 366641704 Feb 12 02:44 fuzzshark_tcp_port-bgp\n-rwxr-xr-x. 1 1000 1000 366641704 Feb 12 02:44 fuzzshark_ip_proto-udp\ndrwxr-xr-x. 1 1000 1000        18 Feb 12 02:51 extcap\nroot@43e8ceacdafb:/work/build/run# ldd ./fuzzshark_ip_proto-udp\n\tlinux-vdso.so.1 (0x00007f9632b32000)\n\tlibdl.so.2 => /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libdl.so.2 (0x00007f9632b1f000)\n\tlibm.so.6 => /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libm.so.6 (0x00007f96329d0000)\n\tlibpthread.so.0 => /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libpthread.so.0 (0x00007f96329ad000)\n\tlibrt.so.1 => /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/librt.so.1 (0x00007f96329a3000)\n\tlibgcc_s.so.1 => /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libgcc_s.so.1 (0x00007f9632988000)\n\tlibc.so.6 => /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libc.so.6 (0x00007f9632796000)\n\t/lib64/ld-linux-x86-64.so.2 (0x00007f9632b34000)\n```\n\nwhich seems correct. (And the latest commit in src/wireshark is the most recent one in master).",
