      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 2343311829,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Hmm. Interesting, some of that oddness I was seeing was when running with podman (which really tries to download images instead of using local ones if --pull is given). I replaced that with docker, and now I'm seeing what you're seeing. Very strange.",
