      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 2343328169,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Although the difference is when running the image it does find the glib2 shared libraries:\n```\nroot@80b7d8c2d4e1:/out# ldd fuzzshark_ip_proto-udp\n\tlinux-vdso.so.1 (0x00007f2662dad000)\n\tlibdl.so.2 => /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libdl.so.2 (0x00007f2662d9a000)\n\tlibglib-2.0.so.0 => /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libglib-2.0.so.0 (0x00007f2662c70000)\n\tlibm.so.6 => /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libm.so.6 (0x00007f2662b21000)\n\tlibpthread.so.0 => /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libpthread.so.0 (0x00007f2662afe000)\n\tlibrt.so.1 => /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/librt.so.1 (0x00007f2662af4000)\n\tlibresolv.so.2 => /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libresolv.so.2 (0x00007f2662ad8000)\n\tlibgcc_s.so.1 => /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libgcc_s.so.1 (0x00007f2662abb000)\n\tlibc.so.6 => /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libc.so.6 (0x00007f26628c9000)\n\t/lib64/ld-linux-x86-64.so.2 (0x00007f2662daf000)\n\tlibpcre.so.3 => /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libpcre.so.3 (0x00007f2662856000)\n```\n\nand it seems to run.",
